description: Allow editor engines to handle structured toolbar operations and release resources on destruction
release: 5.5.0
github-links: https://github.com/TiddlyWiki/TiddlyWiki5/pull/8991
github-contributors: linonetwo
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

The text editor factory supports two optional engine methods:

* `handleEditTextOperation(event)` handles `tm-edit-text-operation` using the engine's own document model. Return `true` to save the resulting text, `false` to decline the operation, or `undefined` to use the existing text-operation handlers.
* `destroy()` releases engine resources when its widget is removed or rerendered.

Engines that omit these methods retain their existing behavior.
